- `src/backend/include/backend/common/Resultado.hpp` -- UNUSED (`exito`, `valor`, `error`, `correcto()`, `fallo()`)
- `src/backend/include/backend/services/Resultado.hpp` -- UNUSED (`ok`, `valor`, `error`, `correcto()`, `fallo()`)

