- `test_composicion_plan.cpp` (178 lines, 8 tests)

**Modified CMake**:
- `src/backend/CMakeLists.txt` -- Added sources (BROKEN: see issues)
- `test/CMakeLists.txt` -- Added test executable (BROKEN: see issues)

